WEBVTT

00:02:51.850 --> 00:02:54.170
<i>Three days have passed since 
that incident in the forest.</i>

00:02:58.020 --> 00:03:00.280
<i>I haven't seen any of them since...</i>

00:03:05.300 --> 00:03:07.120
<i>Or even heard from them.</i>

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:10.210
<i>And we never found Inoue, either.</i>

00:03:08.950 --> 00:03:10.210
No Entry for Students

00:03:14.640 --> 00:03:17.930
<i>Our ordinary lives came to an end.</i>

00:03:18.410 --> 00:03:22.810
Kanbe-san, Konohana-san,
and Ohtori-san are out sick again today.

00:03:23.230 --> 00:03:26.650
There seems to be a cold going around, 
so please be careful, everyone.

00:03:25.760 --> 00:03:29.750
<i>Lucia and Shizuru are members of
a secret organization called Guardian,</i>

00:03:30.110 --> 00:03:33.950
<i>and the president and Chihaya are members 
of their enemy organization, Gaia.</i>

00:03:34.290 --> 00:03:36.150
<i>That's why they disappeared.</i>

00:03:36.150 --> 00:03:37.770
<i>That much makes sense.</i>

00:03:38.190 --> 00:03:40.050
<i>But why Kotori?
She had nothing to do with it.</i>

00:03:40.050 --> 00:03:41.280
The Harvest Festa is coming soon.

00:03:41.620 --> 00:03:42.820
Stay focused,

00:03:42.820 --> 00:03:46.690
and act responsibly as students of
Kazamatsuri Academy.

00:03:46.980 --> 00:03:47.990
That will be all.

00:03:52.120 --> 00:03:54.410
Hey, is Kanbe absent again today?

00:03:54.410 --> 00:03:55.130
Huh?

00:03:55.740 --> 00:03:57.860
Y-Yeah, looks like it.

00:03:57.860 --> 00:03:59.430
It's not just her,

00:03:59.430 --> 00:04:01.050
but Konohana and Ohtori, too.

00:04:01.410 --> 00:04:03.220
Everyone who hangs out with you.

00:04:03.410 --> 00:04:04.620
It's a coincidence.

00:04:04.620 --> 00:04:06.540
There's a cold going around, right?

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:09.350
If you really are in trouble...

00:04:09.350 --> 00:04:10.150
Huh?

00:04:11.870 --> 00:04:13.250
Never mind.

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:20.110
I'm begging you, call me

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:20.110
Canceled

00:04:22.350 --> 00:04:24.280
<i>There's one other thing that bothers me.</i>

00:04:25.150 --> 00:04:29.510
<i>Is there more to my power than
just rewriting my physical abilities</i>

00:04:29.510 --> 00:04:30.620
<i>and enhancing myself?</i>

00:04:44.230 --> 00:04:45.380
I did it!

00:04:47.710 --> 00:04:49.680
I think I have them 
around here somewhere.

00:04:49.680 --> 00:04:50.580
Where are they?

00:04:50.580 --> 00:04:51.520
Found them!

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:54.180
Let's see how sharp they are.

00:04:59.070 --> 00:05:01.170
I-It sliced right through them!

00:05:06.300 --> 00:05:09.530
I've totally gotta try this out
on all sorts of stuff!

00:05:12.800 --> 00:05:13.570
Huh?

00:05:13.960 --> 00:05:15.880
Did I leave the window open?

00:05:26.380 --> 00:05:28.010
Tennouji...

00:05:29.340 --> 00:05:30.140
Kotarou...

00:05:30.990 --> 00:05:32.390
Wh-Why are you here?!

00:05:34.890 --> 00:05:36.140
S-Stay away!

00:05:38.150 --> 00:05:40.270
Stay away from me!

00:05:40.270 --> 00:05:43.690
This is an... emergency situation.

00:05:46.310 --> 00:05:47.070
Huh?

00:05:48.250 --> 00:05:49.110
Hey!

00:05:49.460 --> 00:05:52.420
She wasn't a ghost?

00:05:53.520 --> 00:05:57.430
I have something to tell you 
regarding Inoue-san from Class 2-A,

00:05:57.430 --> 00:05:59.620
who went missing a few days ago.

00:06:02.340 --> 00:06:05.140
<i>We were told that as of a few days ago,</i>

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:07.340
<i>Inoue had been admitted to
a hospital the next town over.</i>

00:06:08.340 --> 00:06:10.340
Special Offer

00:06:08.340 --> 00:06:10.340
<b>Free of Charge</b>

00:06:08.340 --> 00:06:10.340
It's delicious!

00:06:08.340 --> 00:06:10.340
<b>Feecof</b>

00:06:08.840 --> 00:06:12.720
<i>We were only told about this now
because Inoue's memory was foggy,</i>

00:06:12.720 --> 00:06:15.070
<i>and it'd taken some time to identify her.</i>

00:06:16.060 --> 00:06:18.850
<i>While her memory hadn't cleared up yet,</i>

00:06:19.390 --> 00:06:23.350
<i>the fact that she hadn't sustained any
physical injuries was a silver lining.</i>

00:06:24.440 --> 00:06:27.070
<i>However, it was such a 
huge shock to her parents</i>

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:30.420
<i>that Inoue's whole family 
ended up leaving Kazamatsuri.</i>

00:06:37.020 --> 00:06:38.230
Crap.

00:06:38.230 --> 00:06:39.850
If she saw this...

00:06:43.110 --> 00:06:44.840
Lucia will get mad at you,

00:06:45.470 --> 00:06:46.340
Kotarou.

00:06:46.470 --> 00:06:47.900
Sh-Shizuru?

00:06:47.900 --> 00:06:50.360
Wh-Where have you been?

00:06:51.100 --> 00:06:52.750
I came to say goodbye.

00:06:53.040 --> 00:06:54.350
Wh-What the heck?

00:06:54.740 --> 00:06:55.800
That's all.

00:06:56.400 --> 00:06:58.980
There's no need for you 
to worry about a thing.

00:06:59.470 --> 00:07:01.020
So please, lead a happy life.

00:07:03.370 --> 00:07:04.360
Wait, Shizuru!

00:07:05.330 --> 00:07:08.520
The occult club was so much fun. I loved it.

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:11.490
Shizuru!

00:07:27.670 --> 00:07:28.130
What?!

00:07:32.470 --> 00:07:33.610
What in the world?

00:07:33.610 --> 00:07:34.740
Did someone break in?!

00:07:46.950 --> 00:07:48.200
It was her?

00:07:56.760 --> 00:07:57.830
She's not here?

00:08:09.210 --> 00:08:12.050
I sense something strange in... here!

00:08:12.050 --> 00:08:12.960
Here!

00:08:17.360 --> 00:08:18.220
Take that!

00:08:18.220 --> 00:08:18.830
Over here!

00:08:18.830 --> 00:08:19.810
It was a feint!

00:08:24.300 --> 00:08:25.960
My name is Kagari-chan.

00:08:25.960 --> 00:08:27.060
Okay...

00:08:27.060 --> 00:08:29.230
To be blunt, that's all I remember.

00:08:29.550 --> 00:08:32.190
So you're an amnesiac ghost?

00:08:32.190 --> 00:08:34.620
I'm not a ghost. I'm Kagari-chan.

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:36.660
However,

00:08:36.660 --> 00:08:39.780
I believe I was on some sort 
of important mission...

00:08:40.160 --> 00:08:43.750
That is why I need to find myself.

00:08:51.760 --> 00:08:53.010
I need to find myself.

00:08:53.710 --> 00:08:54.510
Don't tell me...

00:08:54.870 --> 00:08:56.760
You want my help?

00:09:01.810 --> 00:09:03.670
What a strange dream.

00:09:07.940 --> 00:09:10.050
Yeah, I knew it!

00:09:12.990 --> 00:09:14.730
What are you up to?

00:09:14.730 --> 00:09:16.980
Uh, I'm going to school.

00:09:17.410 --> 00:09:19.200
Crap. What am I gonna do about her?

00:09:19.200 --> 00:09:22.650
You should help me out instead of 
bothering with school right now.

00:09:22.650 --> 00:09:23.960
Don't be unreasonable.

00:09:23.960 --> 00:09:25.790
Search for yourself <i>by</i> yourself.

00:09:26.030 --> 00:09:27.540
I don't know how.

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:29.640
Go on a trip or something.

00:09:30.230 --> 00:09:30.790
That's it!

00:09:34.140 --> 00:09:37.800
Sorry, but could I get you to 
leave the room for a minute?

00:09:38.620 --> 00:09:40.300
Are you trying to hide something from me?

00:09:40.430 --> 00:09:42.000
Won't you leave for me?

00:09:46.180 --> 00:09:48.230
What in the world have you been 
doing for the last five minutes?

00:09:48.230 --> 00:09:49.610
I was being a modest gentleman.

00:09:49.610 --> 00:09:50.740
Don't worry about it.

00:09:50.740 --> 00:09:52.960
More importantly, look! It's the Internet.

00:09:52.960 --> 00:09:56.500
Humans manage to shop and find their 
way through life on the Internet.

00:09:58.320 --> 00:09:59.570
Today

00:09:58.320 --> 00:09:59.570
No Answer

00:10:02.440 --> 00:10:04.740
I guess even at times like 
these, you get hungry.

00:10:09.450 --> 00:10:10.250
What?!

00:10:14.610 --> 00:10:17.010
Why can't I go into the classroom?

00:10:17.250 --> 00:10:19.540
You're not in this class, are you?

00:10:19.840 --> 00:10:21.890
Hurry back to your own homeroom.

00:10:21.890 --> 00:10:23.920
<i>What is she doing?!</i>

00:10:23.920 --> 00:10:26.600
<i>Wait. Everyone else can see her this time?</i>

00:10:26.720 --> 00:10:32.490
I found on the Internet that Tennouji Kotarou
was attending someplace interesting,

00:10:32.490 --> 00:10:33.110
so I got jeal—

00:10:33.110 --> 00:10:34.400
Tennouji?

00:10:33.530 --> 00:10:35.610
I found that unforgivable and transferred in.

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:35.610
She knows him?

00:10:35.610 --> 00:10:36.600
Huh?

00:10:36.910 --> 00:10:37.960
Anyway,

00:10:37.960 --> 00:10:40.860
common sense says suspicious people
have to be sent to the staff room.

00:10:41.070 --> 00:10:42.680
Don't think badly of me.

00:10:49.620 --> 00:10:50.790
Yoshino-kun got owned!

00:10:51.120 --> 00:10:53.150
That transfer student is strong!

00:10:53.150 --> 00:10:54.880
It's the birth of a new gang leader!

00:10:59.470 --> 00:11:01.340
What do you think you're doing?!

00:11:01.820 --> 00:11:04.640
It's your fault for being mean
and leaving me behind.

00:11:05.080 --> 00:11:08.510
No matter how much you
super-duper totally love me,

00:11:08.510 --> 00:11:10.230
you should be more straightforward about it.

00:11:10.230 --> 00:11:11.520
Hold on. What did you just say?

00:11:11.950 --> 00:11:16.320
I know that human males tend to be mean

00:11:16.320 --> 00:11:17.780
to the females that they like.

00:11:17.780 --> 00:11:18.630
Huh?

00:11:18.630 --> 00:11:21.930
I learned all about humans on the Internet.

00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:24.660
Did I leave you totally speechless?

00:11:25.140 --> 00:11:29.540
Next, I will learn about myself in 
this institution you call a school.

00:11:29.750 --> 00:11:32.820
Schools will only teach you academics.

00:11:34.030 --> 00:11:35.670
How petty...

00:11:35.670 --> 00:11:37.100
Um...

00:11:37.100 --> 00:11:40.350
I'll show you around the building, 
so try to make do with that.

00:11:40.350 --> 00:11:41.530
Kay-o!

00:11:41.530 --> 00:11:43.230
Way to go, Tennouji Kotarou.

00:11:43.230 --> 00:11:44.680
K-Kay-o?

00:11:45.680 --> 00:11:46.930
Just Kotarou is fine.

00:11:46.930 --> 00:11:48.180
Saying the whole thing is annoying.

00:11:48.180 --> 00:11:49.600
Okay, Kotarou.

00:11:50.620 --> 00:11:52.850
By the way, what's with that uniform?

00:11:53.430 --> 00:11:55.680
These clothes are part of my body,

00:11:55.680 --> 00:11:57.730
so I can transform them freely.

00:11:58.390 --> 00:12:02.240
I'm fabulous down to my very core,
so praise me, human.

00:12:02.510 --> 00:12:03.440
Yeah.

00:12:03.440 --> 00:12:05.740
You definitely aren't human.

00:12:06.770 --> 00:12:08.620
First, this is the cafeteria.

00:12:09.040 --> 00:12:11.640
As you can see, 
this is where people eat their meals.

00:12:11.640 --> 00:12:12.770
I see.

00:12:12.770 --> 00:12:15.340
It's a place where you sate
your appetites by devouring

00:12:15.340 --> 00:12:17.500
other lifeforms who live on the same planet.

00:12:18.470 --> 00:12:20.760
Uh, well, you're not wrong...

00:12:21.180 --> 00:12:23.720
In that case, I desire shi-su!

00:12:23.720 --> 00:12:24.490
There isn't any.

00:12:24.490 --> 00:12:26.900
Why'd you suddenly start
having worldly desires?

00:12:29.200 --> 00:12:30.780
What is that?

00:12:31.180 --> 00:12:34.420
Oh, that's a self-service coffee machine.

00:12:35.090 --> 00:12:36.020
Feecof?

00:12:36.020 --> 00:12:37.270
Special Offer

00:12:36.020 --> 00:12:37.270
<b>Free of Charge</b>

00:12:36.020 --> 00:12:37.270
It's delicious!

00:12:36.020 --> 00:12:37.270
<b>Feecof</b>

00:12:38.840 --> 00:12:41.840
Th-This is... myyum!

00:12:41.840 --> 00:12:44.000
<i>They have a reputation for using 
such abysmally cheap beans</i>

00:12:44.000 --> 00:12:46.950
<i>that you wouldn't even want to
drink it for free...</i>

00:12:46.950 --> 00:12:51.410
I'm positive this must have come from 
the hands of a renowned feecof artisan!

00:12:52.040 --> 00:12:54.780
Who created this feecof?!

00:12:55.650 --> 00:12:57.170
I am asking for the hostess!

00:12:57.170 --> 00:12:59.540
I would like to give my compliments 
directly to the human who made this—

00:13:00.710 --> 00:13:02.300
Sorry to disturb you!

00:13:04.810 --> 00:13:08.020
I rushed out of there without thinking
and ended up skipping afternoon classes.

00:13:08.590 --> 00:13:12.720
Your love will come across as oppressive
if you're too mean, Kotarou.

00:13:12.720 --> 00:13:17.170
As a sign of your love, you should offer me
three months' salary worth of feecof.

00:13:17.170 --> 00:13:18.310
How much do you wanna drink?!

00:13:20.330 --> 00:13:22.750
<i>It's been a while since
I've done something like this.</i>

00:13:28.910 --> 00:13:30.360
I-Inoue!

00:13:31.470 --> 00:13:32.690
Why are you here?

00:13:32.690 --> 00:13:34.210
Are you okay? Wait...

00:13:34.210 --> 00:13:36.190
What happened in that forest
 in the first place?

00:13:36.190 --> 00:13:37.290
U-Um...

00:13:37.970 --> 00:13:39.130
Oh, sorry.

00:13:39.130 --> 00:13:40.670
I'm glad you're safe.

00:13:41.590 --> 00:13:43.470
Who were you again?

00:13:43.470 --> 00:13:44.130
Huh?

00:13:44.130 --> 00:13:45.120
I'm sorry.

00:13:45.120 --> 00:13:46.260
I can't remember.

00:13:50.010 --> 00:13:52.100
You know me?

00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:52.850
Yeah.

00:13:52.850 --> 00:13:55.000
You appointed me as your rival.

00:13:55.630 --> 00:13:56.890
What were we rivals in?

00:13:57.230 --> 00:13:59.490
Chasing after the mysteries of Kazamatsuri.

00:13:59.490 --> 00:14:01.990
You were in the newspaper club, 
and I was in the occult club.

00:14:01.990 --> 00:14:03.040
Wow!

00:14:03.040 --> 00:14:05.150
I was in the newspaper club?

00:14:05.150 --> 00:14:07.140
Mysteries, huh?

00:14:07.670 --> 00:14:08.990
Could it be?

00:14:11.710 --> 00:14:13.160
A memory stick?

00:14:13.420 --> 00:14:15.940
I haven't checked what's on it,

00:14:15.940 --> 00:14:19.610
but I was apparently holding it tight
and wouldn't let go,

00:14:19.610 --> 00:14:22.170
even when I was unconscious.

00:14:22.470 --> 00:14:25.880
Something tells me I need 
to give this to you.

00:14:25.880 --> 00:14:26.540
Huh?

00:14:26.540 --> 00:14:28.170
But I'm sure what's on this is—

00:14:28.350 --> 00:14:29.470
It's okay.

00:14:29.950 --> 00:14:34.300
I'm pretty sure this is 
what I came here to do.

00:14:37.180 --> 00:14:38.230
Take care.

00:14:38.230 --> 00:14:39.820
Yeah, bye bye.

00:14:43.310 --> 00:14:44.020
Inoue!

00:14:47.380 --> 00:14:49.390
About our competition...

00:14:50.090 --> 00:14:51.280
You win!

00:14:52.020 --> 00:14:53.100
Um...

00:14:53.660 --> 00:14:54.950
Yay!

00:14:59.670 --> 00:15:03.430
A piece of that human's heart
has been destroyed.

00:15:03.430 --> 00:15:04.040
Huh?

00:15:04.280 --> 00:15:07.060
And yet, she accomplished 
her objective all the same.

00:15:07.520 --> 00:15:08.630
She entrusted it to you?

00:15:09.050 --> 00:15:11.020
I didn't know you could do that.

00:15:16.460 --> 00:15:18.730
The Kagari-chan exploration 
party has returned!

00:15:18.990 --> 00:15:21.500
Don't loiter around my house so much.

00:15:21.500 --> 00:15:23.460
It is quite spacious.

00:15:23.460 --> 00:15:25.570
For you to own this all by yourself,

00:15:25.570 --> 00:15:27.850
you must have done something 
quite underhanded.

00:15:27.850 --> 00:15:29.250
Don't make me sound so shady.

00:15:29.250 --> 00:15:30.490
My parents are the ones who built it.

00:15:30.860 --> 00:15:33.540
By "parents," you mean 
your genetic contributors?

00:15:33.820 --> 00:15:36.030
I have not seen any sign of them.

00:15:36.280 --> 00:15:38.190
They're busy with work.

00:15:38.500 --> 00:15:40.120
They're researchers,

00:15:40.120 --> 00:15:42.650
and they mostly stay over at work.

00:15:42.960 --> 00:15:44.670
It's a corporation associated

00:15:44.670 --> 00:15:47.340
with the environmental protection 
agency known as the Martel Group.

00:15:52.880 --> 00:15:54.970
It appears you have returned, Senri.

00:15:55.190 --> 00:15:55.810
Yes.

00:15:55.810 --> 00:15:57.850
I'm sorry I've been out of 
touch for so long, Suzaki-san.

00:15:58.130 --> 00:16:00.260
There was never any need for you,

00:16:00.260 --> 00:16:03.350
the next saint, to go to school.

00:16:03.650 --> 00:16:07.610
Going forward, please know your role
and act accordingly.

00:16:10.890 --> 00:16:12.110
Accursed little girl...

00:16:15.210 --> 00:16:16.870
Are you finished...

00:16:17.990 --> 00:16:19.370
saying hello?

00:16:22.700 --> 00:16:24.280
Very well, then.

00:16:24.280 --> 00:16:26.170
Now, please get started.

00:16:26.650 --> 00:16:28.960
So then, regarding the Key's movements.

00:16:29.420 --> 00:16:32.810
We haven't been able to pin down its location

00:16:32.810 --> 00:16:34.970
since we detected its presence 
in the city the other day—

00:16:39.650 --> 00:16:40.470
O-Oh?

00:16:43.270 --> 00:16:44.950
I'm back, Shimako.

00:16:49.800 --> 00:16:52.990
Akane-san, there are tons of cobwebs in here!

00:16:53.150 --> 00:16:55.490
I was planning to clean them up later!

00:16:56.390 --> 00:16:58.490
That's an elementary schooler's excuse.

00:17:00.500 --> 00:17:02.180
Is the meeting over?

00:17:02.180 --> 00:17:03.040
Yes.

00:17:03.040 --> 00:17:04.390
Call it a meeting if you like,

00:17:04.390 --> 00:17:07.520
but I was just put on wheelchair 
duty the whole time.

00:17:07.520 --> 00:17:09.380
It's been like that all the time lately.

00:17:09.660 --> 00:17:13.480
When a saint is on the verge of death,
they keep their successor close at hand.

00:17:13.820 --> 00:17:16.010
And she's abiding by that old custom.

00:17:16.290 --> 00:17:17.240
In other words,

00:17:17.240 --> 00:17:20.350
Kashima Sakura doesn't have long to live?

00:17:20.540 --> 00:17:22.850
More importantly, where is 
the item I asked you for?

00:17:22.850 --> 00:17:23.890
Right here.

00:17:24.340 --> 00:17:25.030
This is it!

00:17:25.030 --> 00:17:26.640
I've been waiting for this!

00:17:26.810 --> 00:17:29.680
I was in such a hurry that
I couldn't bring it with me!

00:17:34.790 --> 00:17:36.410
I've returned

00:17:36.410 --> 00:17:38.240
to the motherly embrace of cyberspace!

00:17:38.480 --> 00:17:39.410
Those are unbecoming,

00:17:39.410 --> 00:17:43.730
vulgar words from the next 
Martel... no, Gaia saint.

00:17:43.730 --> 00:17:46.340
Still, I'm sure it never occurred to
Tennouji and the others

00:17:46.340 --> 00:17:50.010
that the club room and
the Martel Japanese headquarters

00:17:50.010 --> 00:17:52.680
were connected by a hidden passage.

00:17:53.540 --> 00:17:55.920
Club activities were a lot of fun.

00:17:58.780 --> 00:18:01.890
They may be our enemies,
but I'm glad we became friends.

00:18:03.090 --> 00:18:06.180
Um, are Kotarou and Kotori all right?

00:18:06.460 --> 00:18:10.770
I mean, they found out our 
secret and everything.

00:18:10.770 --> 00:18:12.940
In regards to that female 
student from the other day,

00:18:13.570 --> 00:18:16.870
Lady Akane found out what 
happened to her

00:18:16.870 --> 00:18:18.450
and sheltered her without 
any further incident.

00:18:18.700 --> 00:18:21.320
There is a danger that as a witness,

00:18:21.320 --> 00:18:23.700
a mark has been put on 
Tennouji by both sides.

00:18:24.790 --> 00:18:26.450
Um, what about Kotori?

00:18:26.450 --> 00:18:27.650
Kanbe is...

00:18:27.920 --> 00:18:30.040
No, never mind.

00:18:31.170 --> 00:18:33.090
I don't have any conclusive proof yet...

00:18:34.840 --> 00:18:37.570
It appears we will need to take 
some precautionary measures.

00:19:10.450 --> 00:19:11.620
I'm counting on you, Lucia.

00:19:12.090 --> 00:19:14.460
It gave up its mobility without a fight.

00:19:14.860 --> 00:19:16.210
Did it underestimate us?

00:19:24.570 --> 00:19:25.840
Now, Shizuru.

00:19:25.840 --> 00:19:26.930
Take your revenge.

00:19:32.100 --> 00:19:33.230
This is goodbye.

00:19:39.540 --> 00:19:41.890
Looks like it's all over, huh, Shizuru-kun?

00:19:41.890 --> 00:19:42.720
Gramps.

00:19:44.310 --> 00:19:45.980
It's over, but this isn't the end.

00:19:45.980 --> 00:19:46.980
You're right.

00:19:47.850 --> 00:19:50.080
Esaka-san, what about the monster user?

00:19:50.080 --> 00:19:52.670
I struck him with my sword, but he got away.

00:19:52.970 --> 00:19:54.940
That was fine work, you two.

00:19:55.480 --> 00:19:56.570
You've grown.

00:19:56.570 --> 00:19:58.590
Shizuru-chan!

00:19:59.300 --> 00:20:00.260
You did it!

00:20:00.260 --> 00:20:01.550
You're not hurt or anything, are you?

00:20:02.210 --> 00:20:03.070
Ahem.

00:20:04.600 --> 00:20:07.990
W-We have finished cleaning up the 
monsters in this area, Instructor!

00:20:07.990 --> 00:20:09.060
No, Esaka-san!

00:20:09.750 --> 00:20:12.640
It has been some time since I retired,

00:20:12.930 --> 00:20:15.280
but our enemy has become quite sloppy.

00:20:15.280 --> 00:20:18.560
Kazamatsuri is holy ground 
for the followers of Gaia,

00:20:18.560 --> 00:20:21.120
so various monster users gather here.

00:20:21.520 --> 00:20:23.200
Do you suppose this is due to the Key?

00:20:23.410 --> 00:20:27.700
There seems to be little other reason 
for such a great number of monsters

00:20:27.990 --> 00:20:29.990
to be deployed to the city and 
forest before the Harvest Festa.

00:20:29.990 --> 00:20:31.070
Esaka-san,

00:20:31.070 --> 00:20:34.550
I am very grateful that all of you 
veterans have returned to the front lines.

00:20:35.130 --> 00:20:36.460
Something big is about to happen.

00:20:36.790 --> 00:20:37.950
Prepare yourselves.

00:20:37.950 --> 00:20:38.680
Yes!

00:20:39.680 --> 00:20:40.460
Now,

00:20:40.850 --> 00:20:42.720
I've got a job for you two.

00:20:44.460 --> 00:20:46.970
If I recall, you are Gil-san 
and Pani-san, correct?

00:20:49.220 --> 00:20:49.930
This is awesome!

00:20:50.210 --> 00:20:52.680
The crude sin you committed 
against Chihaya-san...

00:20:55.900 --> 00:20:58.380
It appears you will finally 
be able to make up for it.

00:21:01.360 --> 00:21:03.070
<i>After getting stranded in the forest,</i>

00:21:03.700 --> 00:21:06.820
<i>Inoue left behind notes about her close 
encounters with the many monsters,</i>

00:21:06.820 --> 00:21:09.390
<i>and mysterious, robed men.</i>

00:21:09.880 --> 00:21:10.780
<i>And...</i>

00:21:11.080 --> 00:21:14.730
<i>Her declaration that organizations likely 
existed in the underbelly of Kazamatsuri,</i>

00:21:14.730 --> 00:21:16.830
<i>accusations of the danger they posed,</i>

00:21:17.330 --> 00:21:19.630
<i>and admitting that the occult was real,</i>

00:21:19.630 --> 00:21:22.590
<i>all must have amounted to a 
concession speech to her, in a way.</i>

00:21:23.580 --> 00:21:25.480
<i>She must have been so upset.</i>

00:21:26.940 --> 00:21:28.590
Please switch with me.

00:21:29.030 --> 00:21:32.210
The next part of the web comic 
I am interested in came out.

00:21:32.210 --> 00:21:33.890
Hey, don't mess with it from the side.

00:21:33.890 --> 00:21:34.540
Huh?

00:21:36.180 --> 00:21:37.930
What is this?

00:21:38.500 --> 00:21:41.550
Something about this place bothers me.

00:21:41.550 --> 00:21:42.220
Huh?

00:21:42.220 --> 00:21:44.400
Is this actually your 
birthplace or something?

00:21:47.560 --> 00:21:48.630
<i>Sorry for not responding.</i>

00:21:48.630 --> 00:21:51.110
<i>I caught a terrible cold and
 will be out for a while,</i>

00:21:51.110 --> 00:21:52.490
<i>but no need to worry!</i>

00:21:54.120 --> 00:21:57.240
What's this idiot telling 
such an obvious lie for?

00:21:57.240 --> 00:21:58.000
But...

00:21:58.420 --> 00:22:00.300
You're okay, huh?

00:22:00.300 --> 00:22:01.000
Kotori...

00:22:03.000 --> 00:22:04.520
<i>Make sure you get better.</i>

00:22:04.520 --> 00:22:07.690
<i>Want me to nurse you and 
wipe away your sweat?</i>

00:22:08.790 --> 00:22:10.690
No debauchery. Let's keep it PG.

00:22:23.040 --> 00:22:24.300
I have to hurry.

00:22:32.700 --> 00:22:39.210
Episode 8
"My Name is Kagari-chan"
